{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/26d80df79dfe719b91b482cab607cdb7.avif?t=1770382545\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras_big/26d80df79dfe719b91b482cab607cdb7.webp?t=1770382545 width=1560 height=312 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robot 9527, prepare for deployment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a massive and mysterious mechanical city, where gears roar day and night, and countless small robots toil to keep the tower running. After long ages, the Machine Tower is now decaying and riddled with danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your tools, check your gear, and set out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/a94e6b020df30255e51119bc7630d78c.avif?t=1770382545\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras_big/a94e6b020df30255e51119bc7630d78c.webp?t=1770382545 width=1560 height=312 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the path to exploring the Machine Tower, you'll need all sorts of handy tools!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Machine Tower 2984</i>, a variety of weapons and a wealth of skills are yours to mix and match, allowing you to freely create your own exclusive combat flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your unique combat combo to drive back the enemy and make the entire tower remember your name!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/ad037ed8082496beb02ef85b20b3af16.poster.avif?t=1770382545\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/ad037ed8082496beb02ef85b20b3af16.webm?t=1770382545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/ad037ed8082496beb02ef85b20b3af16.mp4?t=1770382545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/8f4b93268c97258731d99e2cdff68d43.avif?t=1770382545\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras_big/8f4b93268c97258731d99e2cdff68d43.webp?t=1770382545 width=1560 height=312 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interior of the Machine Tower has long since transformed into a deadly labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ground spikes pop out without warning, rusty bomb robots are ready to detonate at any moment, and massive steel hammers descend from above, trying to smash you into scrap metal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step is like walking on thin ice. Only by staying calm and anticipating the dangers can you walk out of this death trap alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/4adc4b0af7f54a966b4df6321793fff0.poster.avif?t=1770382545\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/4adc4b0af7f54a966b4df6321793fff0.webm?t=1770382545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/4adc4b0af7f54a966b4df6321793fff0.mp4?t=1770382545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/3054b365330110b2ec65ac7870274f8d.avif?t=1770382545\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras_big/3054b365330110b2ec65ac7870274f8d.webp?t=1770382545 width=1560 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lurking on every floor of the Machine Tower are lethal mechanical guards. They can transform, spin, and charge, using merciless attacks to repel intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must learn their rhythm and survive in the gaps between gunfire and steel. Dodge with wit, counterattack with firepower, and find victory in desperation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/af85c26fcda70f3bdba5af52bc4b937e.poster.avif?t=1770382545\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/af85c26fcda70f3bdba5af52bc4b937e.webm?t=1770382545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/af85c26fcda70f3bdba5af52bc4b937e.mp4?t=1770382545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/b26f26dc9350e338bb8a1675a12bd4ee.avif?t=1770382545\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras_big/b26f26dc9350e338bb8a1675a12bd4ee.webp?t=1770382545 width=1560 height=312 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mechanical Overlords are ruthless and highly skilled. Each one has a unique specialty, and it's as if the entire tower fights for them! Defeat them to tear open the secrets of the Machine Tower and get closer to the truth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/4cd3da01f3b6ecd10a521ab9abd8c32d.poster.avif?t=1770382545\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/4cd3da01f3b6ecd10a521ab9abd8c32d.webm?t=1770382545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/4cd3da01f3b6ecd10a521ab9abd8c32d.mp4?t=1770382545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/4029a2756f66051e5c85ed6c9860faa6.avif?t=1770382545\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras_big/4029a2756f66051e5c85ed6c9860faa6.webp?t=1770382545 width=1560 height=312 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't be alone on your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will meet a variety of robots with different personalities\u2014some are quirky, some are warm-hearted, and others are shrouded in mystery, each with their own unique story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend them to make your adventure easier and more exciting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras/e7ca811ce44955acde393105d2cc1e6a.avif?t=1770382545\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452900/extras_big/e7ca811ce44955acde393105d2cc1e6a.avif?t=1770382545 width=800 height=278 /></span></p>","achievements":{"